  "body": "Beautifully renovated, bathed in sunshine and effortlessly stylish, this gorgeous two-bedroom home offers the perfect blend of contemporary elegance, comfort and easy-care living in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal locations.\r\n\r\nElevated, light-filled and wonderfully airy, this beautifully presented unit has been thoughtfully transformed with a sophisticated palette of soft, neutral tones and quality finishes throughout, creating a warm and inviting home with a timeless sense of style.\r\n\r\nThe spacious lounge flows effortlessly onto a sunny outdoor patio, perfectly positioned to capture the elevated outlook and enjoy your morning coffee or evening unwind. Separate garden areas offer additional outdoor retreats, providing the perfect balance of privacy, sunshine and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nAdding to its appeal is a versatile additional rumpus/garage space downstairs, ideal for a home office, hobby room or quiet retreat, complemented by another valuable storage space adjacent to this and off-street parking.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location!\r\nCity-fringe convenience meets the enviable coastal lifestyle of St Heliers. Think morning walks along the waterfront, beautiful beaches, coastal boardwalks, leisurely café catch-ups and vibrant village living, all within easy reach of the city.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the lifestyle privileges of this prestigious Eastern Bays address without the premium price tag traditionally associated with St Heliers. It's a wonderful opportunity to enjoy a little luxury, an exceptional location and all the benefits of easy-care living.\r\n\r\nWith local shops, amenities, transport connections and sought-after schools including St Thomas's School, Selwyn College and Baradene College nearby, convenience comes naturally.\r\n\r\nPerfect for professional couples, first-home buyers, downsizers or those seeking a stylish lock-up-and-leave, this beautifully renovated home offers an exceptional balance of quality, location and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nA little luxury, a whole lot of lifestyles and a St Heliers address to be proud of.\r\nWe look forward to welcoming you at the open homes.\r\n\r\nTo download the property files, please go:\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/A14C",
